    "created_at": "2016-12-21T21:05:11Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-12-21T21:05:11Z",
    "body": "In general the web security model does not allow for protection against embedding third-party scripts---if you allow that, you allow so much that it's not even worthwhile trying to salvage your security story---so I doubt this will gain implementer interest. But I've tagged it appropriately.",
