    "created_at": "2016-12-21T21:19:51Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-12-21T21:19:51Z",
    "body": "Changing the web security model is a huge undertaking that would go against years of progress and work; again, I doubt people will be interested. You're better off running such untrusted scripts in their own cross-origin iframes, where they cannot change your DOM.",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
    "pin": null,
