    "created_at": "2016-12-21T21:59:49Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-12-21T21:59:49Z",
    "body": "The issue is that implementers are generally not interested in adding features to help situations that will always be fundamentally insecure (such as embedding untrusted scripts) produce additional security signals.",
