    "created_at": "2017-01-10T00:10:43Z",
    "updated_at": "2017-01-10T00:10:43Z",
    "body": "Given the security problems with the model proposed here, the lack of implementer interest, and the alternative @annevk pointed out, I think it's best we close this thread. We're certainly happy to continue discussing in the closed thread, and if you can find implementer interest for your idea, that's a path forward. But I don't think this represents a realistic feature proposal we should keep open and tracking, at this point.\r\n\r\nThanks for your interest!",
